  "text": "proprium.pretiosissimi-sanguinis-domini-nostri-iesu-christi-graduale",
  "about": "The graduale of the formulary “Most Precious Blood of Our Lord Jesus Christ” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": {
      "translation": "This is He Who came in water and in blood, Jesus Christ; not in the water only, but in the water and in the blood. There are three that bear witness in heaven: the Father, the Word, and the Holy Spirit; and these three are one. And there are three that bear witness on earth: the Spirit, the water, and the blood; and these three are one."
    }
  },
